  "description": "If there is no marriage in the family within this year, the plague will dry up the family seed.”\n\nWith its beautiful appearance and the restraint of the highest power in Baekhaguk, the mere existence of Baekhaguk\n\nfamous person\n\nEach of the quadruplets has a suspicious secret. The eldest Yeon Yeon-yoon is the owner of a body weaker than an ant, the second child Yeon-gyeom has the memory of a chicken head who can't even remember his parents' faces, the third child Yeon-jin Jin is the strongest Gil-chi who can't even find his own room, and the youngest Yeon Ji-ah has super strength that can take down a tiger with her bare hands. is the owner\n\nTo these people, their father, Prime Minister Yeon, delivers a sudden message... I don't want to get married all of a sudden, but I have to have a 'love' marriage?!\n\nA grand plan to sell out the brothers to avoid the marriage of the youngest daughter, Yeon Ji-ah, who does not want to marry the most powerful family in Baekha-guk, who has been cursed out of nowhere!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62033250), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%98%BC%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%B4%EC%A3%BC%EC%98%A4/3589)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/163379), Spanish, [Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romantic-fantasy/become-my-betrothed/list?title_no=8085), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romantic-fantasy/marry-me-please/list?title_no=10319)",
